SYNTHETIC – a trace log written in ISO-8859-1 (3 lines, LF): the umlauts and the sharp s of
"Müller", "Hauptstraße" and "Größe" and the micro sign of "µm" are single bytes (0xFC, 0xDF,
0xF6, 0xB5), so the window is not valid UTF-8; keep the bytes, see .gitattributes.
Expected from LogExcerpt.build: kind text, charset ISO-8859-1, lines 1–3 decoded with the
characters above unchanged.
Used by LogExcerptTest (tasks.md T015, research D-10).
